    <description>CutGeek removes the background from a photo on your own machine and gives it back at full
resolution. The free web services downsize the result, watermark it, or hold the full-size version
behind a subscription. This one does not.

* Remove the background from a photo and save a transparent PNG
* Keeps the original resolution - no downscaling of the result
* Batch a folder of images in one run
* Runs offline once installed, so the photos are never uploaded anywhere
* No account, no adverts, no watermark, no credit system

Open source under GPL-3.0. The .NET 8 runtime is bundled, so there is nothing to install first.</description>
    <summary>Free offline background remover for Windows - full resolution, no uploads, no watermark</summary>
